        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "Designs are good. Lightweight items also available. Making charges are on high side w.r.t. other brands. What I felt bad about service is usually tea or coffee is asked to customer within 5-10min of entering. In my case, after 20-25min, when we confirmed 1 item and moved on to buy other items, they offered courtesy. This kind of courtesy I have not expected from this reputed brand.",
